{"3824720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Descent Of Lunaris", "steam_appid": 3824720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE SIGNAL BELOW</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2070.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lunar mining operation detects a signal emanating from deep within the moon. Moments later, systems fail, machines turn hostile, and much of the base is lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are sent to investigate and lead a team of operatives into a shifting lunar underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you descend within the moon, you encounter twisted reflections of civilization—structures and forms that should not exist, yet feel disturbingly familiar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you being tested… or judged?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where this descent leads, and what waits at the bottom may change humanity forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/3587d52e4d9b742e25022b0f9d541b2a.poster.avif?t=1779324644\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/3587d52e4d9b742e25022b0f9d541b2a.webm?t=1779324644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/3587d52e4d9b742e25022b0f9d541b2a.mp4?t=1779324644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A STABILITY SYSTEM THAT CHANGES EVERYTHING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push deeper for greater rewards, or retreat before you’re overwhelmed.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stability degrades as you explore, increasing risk and reward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More instability leads to more dramatic and dangerous combat encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your environment can shift and reveal new pathways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High instability unlocks rare encounters, events, and opportunities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful, danger can follow you </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SQUAD-BASED STRATEGY THAT DEFINES YOUR SURVIVAL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your team is your greatest weapon, and your biggest risk.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build from 9 classes and eventually 18 subclasses, each with distinct roles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create powerful combinations of skills between party members</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap operatives at the lunar base to adjust your strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade skills, equip gear, and specialize for survival</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TWO COMBAT SYSTEMS. ONE ESCALATING THREAT.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter tests your planning, positioning, and control.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage frontline and backline roles and optimize your attacks in first-person formation combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement, positioning, and environmental hazards matter in tactical combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploit enemy weaknesses with damage types and skills to buff your team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Damage types matter. Check your loadout for Sharp, Blunt, Kinetic, Energy, and Spirit </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to evolving enemy patterns, or be overwhelmed</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/afbf3ab28617aadc5adf52c301f64875.poster.avif?t=1779324644\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/afbf3ab28617aadc5adf52c301f64875.webm?t=1779324644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/afbf3ab28617aadc5adf52c301f64875.mp4?t=1779324644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic dungeon crawlers, reimagined through modern design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique stability system that dynamically alters encounters and difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Party-based dungeon crawling with deep team customization</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 classes + 18 subclasses with unique roles and skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep build variety and strategic flexibility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your team of 4 from a variety of ranged and close combat operatives</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two types of combat scenarios: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >first-person formation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >tactical grid-based combat</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple approaches to combat, exploration, and squad composition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique style and tone, with art and music from underground artists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty modes, including INSANE</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY THE DEMO</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your descent now.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the narrative driven prologue </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your first squad of operatives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the opening level of the lunar dig site</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience how stability impacts combat, exploration, and survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find what lurks within the dungeon - with 4 boss/mini-bosses to challenge</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/04a608358370da2d8510ed1862c50601.poster.avif?t=1779324644\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/04a608358370da2d8510ed1862c50601.webm?t=1779324644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/04a608358370da2d8510ed1862c50601.mp4?t=1779324644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE SIGNAL BELOW</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2070.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lunar mining operation detects a signal emanating from deep within the moon. Moments later, systems fail, machines turn hostile, and much of the base is lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are sent to investigate and lead a team of operatives into a shifting lunar underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you descend within the moon, you encounter twisted reflections of civilization—structures and forms that should not exist, yet feel disturbingly familiar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you being tested… or judged?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where this descent leads, and what waits at the bottom may change humanity forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/3587d52e4d9b742e25022b0f9d541b2a.poster.avif?t=1779324644\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/3587d52e4d9b742e25022b0f9d541b2a.webm?t=1779324644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/3587d52e4d9b742e25022b0f9d541b2a.mp4?t=1779324644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A STABILITY SYSTEM THAT CHANGES EVERYTHING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push deeper for greater rewards, or retreat before you’re overwhelmed.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stability degrades as you explore, increasing risk and reward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More instability leads to more dramatic and dangerous combat encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your environment can shift and reveal new pathways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High instability unlocks rare encounters, events, and opportunities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful, danger can follow you </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SQUAD-BASED STRATEGY THAT DEFINES YOUR SURVIVAL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your team is your greatest weapon, and your biggest risk.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build from 9 classes and eventually 18 subclasses, each with distinct roles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create powerful combinations of skills between party members</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap operatives at the lunar base to adjust your strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade skills, equip gear, and specialize for survival</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TWO COMBAT SYSTEMS. ONE ESCALATING THREAT.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter tests your planning, positioning, and control.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage frontline and backline roles and optimize your attacks in first-person formation combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement, positioning, and environmental hazards matter in tactical combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploit enemy weaknesses with damage types and skills to buff your team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Damage types matter. Check your loadout for Sharp, Blunt, Kinetic, Energy, and Spirit </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to evolving enemy patterns, or be overwhelmed</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/afbf3ab28617aadc5adf52c301f64875.poster.avif?t=1779324644\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/afbf3ab28617aadc5adf52c301f64875.webm?t=1779324644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/afbf3ab28617aadc5adf52c301f64875.mp4?t=1779324644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic dungeon crawlers, reimagined through modern design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique stability system that dynamically alters encounters and difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Party-based dungeon crawling with deep team customization</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 classes + 18 subclasses with unique roles and skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep build variety and strategic flexibility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your team of 4 from a variety of ranged and close combat operatives</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two types of combat scenarios: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >first-person formation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >tactical grid-based combat</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple approaches to combat, exploration, and squad composition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique style and tone, with art and music from underground artists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty modes, including INSANE</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY THE DEMO</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your descent now.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the narrative driven prologue </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your first squad of operatives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the opening level of the lunar dig site</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience how stability impacts combat, exploration, and survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find what lurks within the dungeon - with 4 boss/mini-bosses to challenge</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/04a608358370da2d8510ed1862c50601.poster.avif?t=1779324644\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/04a608358370da2d8510ed1862c50601.webm?t=1779324644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/04a608358370da2d8510ed1862c50601.mp4?t=1779324644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "short_description": "Assemble your squad and explore a lunar base where cosmic horrors warp your reality, challenge your strategy, and break your sanity. Descent of Lunaris is a grid-based dungeon crawling RPG inspired by Wizardry and Shin Megami Tensei.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/b25e42fa8fc5f813893cbf90e9513d8289eb164a/header.jpg?t=1779324644", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/40210c6e31bf945ecfe948dadf02c8458cd36586/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779324644", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/40210c6e31bf945ecfe948dadf02c8458cd36586/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779324644", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Unison Games"], "publishers": ["Unison Games"], "demos": [{"appid": 4461290, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 18, "description": "Partial Controller Support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/e772964d7035bc768933bf2bb86de8c889fd5126/ss_e772964d7035bc768933bf2bb86de8c889fd5126.600x338.jpg?t=1779324644", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com